31-5-234. Unlawful operation of vehicle by youthful
driver with detectable alcohol concentration; penalty.
(e) A person convicted of violating this section
shall be guilty of a misdemeanor punishable by a fine of
not more than seven hundred fifty dollars ($750.00). A
person convicted of violating this section a second time
within one (1) year of the first conviction is guilty of a
